{"id":"F2","category":"definition-mismatch","severity":"low","decl":"Ehrhart.normalizedVolume","line":24,"paper_ref":null,"explanation":"The name suggests normalization (e.g. n!·vol), but the definition is plain Lebesgue volume, which is what the paper's vol(K) means and what sharpConstant is compared against. The definition is consistent with the paper.","polarity":"n/a","probe_idea":null},
